<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on Taiwan Securities basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Taiwan Securities basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Wednesday it proposed to issue 10 million American-style U.S. dollar composite call warrants on a basket of five securities stocks traded in Taiwan's secondary market.</p>
<p>Each basket is comprised of:</p>
<p> Polaris Securities			    1   share</p>
<p> Grand Cathay Securities		     1   share</p>
<p> Yuanta Securities			     1   share</p>
<p> Capital Securities			    1   share</p>
<p> National Securities			   1   share</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$6.08	 PREMIUM	 16.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$0.985	GEARING	 6.17x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  13.AUG.97     PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG    MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> SPOT		  US$6.08 or 167.2 NTD</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
